<title>BANGLADESH: Chittagong port handles 10,991 tonnes of cargo.</title>
<headline>Chittagong port handles 10,991 tonnes of cargo.</headline>
<dateline>CHITTAGONG, Bangladesh 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh's main port of Chittagong handled 10,991 tonnes of export and import cargo in the 24 hours ending 1:00 p.m. (0700 GMT) on Monday, compared with 12,354 tonnes in the same period on Sunday, port officials said.</p>
<p>Cargo handling in tonnes:</p>
<p>					 Monday		  Sunday</p>
<p>    Export cargo		   3,398		   1,751</p>
<p>    Import cargo		   7,593		  10,603</p>
<p>Berthing schedule of major vessels unloading or expected to unload at Chittagong port:</p>
<p>    Commodity	   Tonnes	 Ship	     Berthing</p>
<p>    Cement		23,079     Evandros-K	   7/10</p>
<p>    Peas		  20,865     Ikan Selar	   7/10</p>
<p>    Fertilizer	  26,559     INCE-B		11/10</p>
<p>    Wheat		 29,026     Overseas Alice    22/10</p>
<p>-- Dhaka Newsroom 880-2-506363</p>
</text>
